<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Monday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities vary slightly.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p> Bank of America     10.375/10.20   10.60 /10.40   11.125/11.00</p>
<p> BPI		     10.40 /10.25   10.65 /10.45   11.125/11.00</p>
<p> Citibank		10.40 /10.30   10.625/10.50   11.125/11.00</p>
<p> Hongkong Bank	 10.40 /10.20   10.70 /10.55   11.20 /11.05</p>
<p> Metrobank	     10.50 /10.25   10.60 /10.50   11.00 /10.95</p>
<p> Multinational	 10.50 /10.25   10.625/10.475  11.125/10.925</p>
<p> PNB		     10.35 /10.25   10.625/10.50   11.10 /11.00</p>
<p> StandChart Bank     10.45 /10.35   10.75 /10.60   11.20 /11.05</p>
<p>* To contribute to this page, please fax your quotes to Reuters Manila newsroom on (632) 817 6267. For details, please phone (632) 841 8937</p>
